<title>USA: Cole National Q4 oper shr $0.94 vs $0.94.</title>
<headline>Cole National Q4 oper shr $0.94 vs $0.94.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited - $ in thousands except earnings per share)</p>
<p>							 Analytical Results</p>
<p>			  53 Wks Ended   52 Wks Ended  52 Wks Ended</p>
<p>				   Feb. 3,	  Feb. 1,     Feb. 1,</p>
<p>					1996	     1997	 1997</p>
<p> Net revenue		    577,091	  683,990    621,776</p>
<p>Business integration</p>
<p>and other</p>
<p>     non-recurring charges	 --	   64,400	   --</p>
<p>Total costs and</p>
<p>  expenses		 531,135	  696,351    569,940</p>
<p>Income (loss) from</p>
<p>   operations		    45,956	 (12,361)     51,836</p>
<p> Interest expense, net	 21,388	   22,031     18,630</p>
